CODE EXPLANATION
====================================================================

1. express()
   Creates Express application.

2. express.json()
   Converts JSON request into JavaScript object.

3. mongoose.connect()
   Connects Node.js with MongoDB.

4. mongoose.Schema()
   Defines structure of MongoDB collection.

5. mongoose.model()
   Creates model for database operations.

6. app.post()
   Used for CREATE operation.

7. app.get()
   Used for READ operation.

8. app.put()
   Used for UPDATE operation.

9. app.delete()
   Used for DELETE operation.

10. app.listen()
   Starts server on specific port.

